+# Fetch limits and mirrors
+
+Per-domain rate limit enforced during corpus fetch (Svipall):
+
+- 12 visits per 60 s window, per domain
+- 900 s cooldown after a breach
+
+Mirror/CDN hosts used to fetch files:
+
+- raw.githubusercontent.com
+- cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/owner/repo@branch/path
+- cdn.statically.io (slow, occasional timeouts)
